WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Turn and push the racket

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Right hand back to 6 o'clock

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Right hand back to 6 o'clock · Left hand pushes to 3 o'clock

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Right hand back to 6 o'clock · Left hand pushes to 3 o'clock · Turn fully sideways, left shoulder to the ball

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Racket drop

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Racket drop · Support hand pulls outward

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Drive the shoulder · Lead with the elbow · Turn the waist

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Racket face covers and drives through

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Contact point in front

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.500
Drive your weight forward
